| 2 | F#4/Gb4 | C#4/Db4 | A3 | E3 | B2 | F#2/Gb2 |
| 3 | G4 | D4 | A#3/Bb3 | F3 | C3 | G2 |
| 4 | G#4/Ab4 | D#4/Eb4 | B3 | F#3/Gb3 | C#3/Db3 | G#2/Ab2 |
